://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Loyalsoldier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"Claude","id":242468646,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODnPHJg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2246796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-code-agent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Claude/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-09-30T23:32:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:03:30Z","closed_at":"2026-10-01T01:25:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/pulls/530","html_url":"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/pull/530","diff_url":"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/pull/530.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/pull/530.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-01T01:25:13Z"},"body":"A full pass over the repo looking for typos and latent bugs. The repo is just the build workflow, the README and the Dependabot config, so the changes are small.\n\n### Workflow (`.github/workflows/run.yml`)\n- Every `curl -sSL $URL` becomes `curl -sSL \"$URL\"`. Unquoted, the shell word-splits and globs the value before `curl` sees it. For example, `PETERLOWE_REJECT_URL` contains `?`, which the shell treats as a filename wildcard, so a matching file in the working directory would replace the URL. Only the quoting changes.\n\n```diff\n- curl -sSL $PETERLOWE_REJECT_URL | perl -ne ...\n+ curl -sSL \"$PETERLOWE_REJECT_URL\" | perl -ne ...\n```\n\n### README\n- Line 48: removed a stray space in `（广告域名列表） 移除`.\n- Line 196: `。设置类别` → `，设置类别`. The full stop cut the `由于…` sentence off before its main clause.\n\n### Found but not changed (flagging for review)\n- **`reject-reserve.txt` is never created.** The workflow checks for it, but nothing writes it. So `full:`, `regexp:` and `keyword:` rules never reach `category-ads-all`, unlike the direct and proxy lists. It does nothing today and causes no error.\n- **Windows host-list filter is loose.** `grep \"0.0.0.0\" | awk '{print $2}'` treats `.` as \"any character\" and also matches commented-out lines. `awk '$1==\"0.0.0.0\"{print $2}'` would be stricter, but it can change the generated output, so it's left out of this PR.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/issues/530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/issues/530/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}